@startuml
title Backend order processing and SSE subscriptions
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
autonumber
participant "Browser" as B
participant "OrderManagementController" as C
participant "OrderManagementService" as S
participant "orderUpdateScheduler" as Q
participant "OrderUpdateEventNotificationManager" as M
participant "In-memory subscriber registry" as R
participant "Per-client SseEmitter" as E
B->C: POST /api/v1/create-order
alt Quantity exceeds 100
C-->B: 400 Bad Request
else Quantity passes controller check
C->S: createOrder(request)
S->S: Validate item, address, positive quantity
alt Service validation fails
S-->C: ResponseStatusException (400)
C-->B: 400 Bad Request
else Valid order
S->S: Generate UUID orderId
S->Q: scheduleAtFixedRate(task, 10s delay, 10s period)
S-->C: orderId
C-->B: 202 Accepted + orderId
end
end
note over B,E: Following flow applies to an accepted order
B->C: GET /api/v1/event/order-update?orderId=...
C->M: subscriber(orderId)
M->E: Create SseEmitter(120000 ms)
M->R: Add emitter to set for orderId
M->E: Register completion, timeout, error cleanup
M-->C: SseEmitter
C-->B: Long-lived text/event-stream response
loop Six stages, starting at 10s and then every 10s
Q->S: Run scheduled task, select next OrderStage
S->M: sendUpdate(orderId, stage, message)
M->R: Find active subscribers for orderId
alt No subscribers
M->M: Log, skip sending, workflow continues
else Subscribers available
loop Each subscribed emitter
M->E: send(id, event=order-update, JSON payload)
E-->B: Stream event to this client
opt Send throws IOException or RuntimeException
M->R: Remove failed emitter
M->E: completeWithError(error)
end
end
opt Stage is DELIVERED
M->E: complete() remaining emitters
M->R: Remove order subscription entry
end
end
opt Stage is DELIVERED
S->Q: Cancel scheduled task
end
end
opt Emitter completes, times out, or errors
E->M: Lifecycle callback
M->R: Remove emitter, remove empty order entry
end
@enduml
